Package: CGMmfpt
Type: Package
Title: Mean First-Passage Time Methods for Continuous Glucose Monitoring
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yuanzhi", "Yu", role = "aut"),
    person("Margaret M.", "Banker", role = "aut"),
    person("Denise M.", "Scholtens", email = "dscholtens@northwestern.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Fits empirical three-state transition models and hidden Markov
    models with beta-uniform mixture emissions to continuous glucose monitoring
    data. Adjacent hidden-state supports may overlap around prespecified or
    data-driven cutoffs. Participant-level transition matrices are summarized
    by mean first-passage time to a target state.
